            "block_content": "c. The cost of a second or third diagnostic opinion; pre- and/or post-admission testing; out-patient surgery; birthing center costs; certified nurse midwives and licensed midwives; mammography; and Hospice treatment to $7,500 shall be provided without deductible or co-insurance costs to the teacher.",
