            "block_content": "g. A Preferred Provider Organization (PPO) Program shall be made available which waives deductible and co-insurance costs. The PPO shall include referrals by a PPO physician outside the immediate area. Should circumstances beyond the control of the Board necessitate changes which impact this program, the parties shall immediately meet to attempt to mitigate the adverse impact upon the teachers.",
